  m_text: "- Aurel Barnea (coordonator), Istorie. Manual pentru clasa a IX-a, Editura
    Corint, Bucure\u0219ti, 2004\r\n- Emil Condurachi, Curs de istoria Orientului
    antic, Universitatea Bucure\u0219ti, 1980\r\n- Daniel, Cultura spiritual\u0103
    a Egiptului antic, Editura Cartea Rom\xE2neasc\u0103, Bucure\u0219ti, 1985\r\n-
    Ovidiu Drimba, Istoria culturii \u0219i civiliza\u021Biei, vol. I, Editura \u0218tiin\u021Bific\u0103
    \u0219i Enciclopedic\u0103, Bucure\u0219ti, 1984\r\n- Alexandru Bogdan Stan,
    10 lucruri incredibile despre faraonul Tutankhamon, \xEEn \u201EHistoria.ro\u201D,
    online\r\n- Alexandra \u0218erban, Morm\xE2ntul lui Tutankamon, plin de lucruri
    minunate. M\u0103rturiile celui care a descoperit comoara din Valea Regilor,
    \xEEn Historia,ro, online\r\n- Wikipedia, Tomb of Tutankhamun, online\r\n- \"The
    Discovery of the Tomb of Tutankhamun\" de Nicholas Reeves\r\n- \"Tutankhamun:
    The Treasures of the Golden Pharaoh\" de Zahi Hawass\r\n- \"Tutankhamun: The
    Life and Death of a Pharaoh\" de Christine El Mahdy\r\n- \"Tutankhamun: The Life
    and Death of the Boy-King\" de Christine El Mahdy\r\n- Situl web oficial al Muzeului
    Egiptean din Cairo, Egipt, online\r\n- \"The Curse of King Tut's Tomb\" de Zahi
    Hawass\r\n- \"Tutankhamun: Anatomy of an Excavation\" de Zahi Hawass\r\n   -
    \"The Treasures of Tutankhamun\" de T.G.H. James\r\n   - \"Egyptian Mythology:
    A Guide to the Gods, Goddesses, and Traditions of Ancient Egypt\" de Geraldine
    Pinch\r\n- Wikipedia, Masca lui Tutankhamon, online\r\n- historia.ro, Egiptul
    Antic \u0219i secretele mumific\u0103rii, online\r"
